OL,3,GNEWSAFirearm discharged in 'targeted
OL,4,Aattack' in Kilmarnock
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for information
OL,7,Fafter a firearm was discharged at a
OL,8,Fproperty in Kilmarnock in what is
OL,9,Fbelieved to be a targeted attack.
OL,11,FOfficers received a report of a window
OL,12,Fbeing damaged at a flat on Mosshead
OL,13,FRoad shortly after 20:00 on 12 October.
OL,15,FPolice Scotland said an investigation
OL,16,Finvolving specialist officers has
OL,17,Festablished a firearm was involved in
OL,18,Fthe incident.
OL,20,FNo one was injured in the incident.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
